    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 23 Limekiln Drive, a superbly upgraded and beautifully finished three-bed dormer bungalow, ideally positioned within a highly sought-after residential estate. Thoughtfully upgraded over the past nine years, this exceptional home is presented in true turnkey condition, with no expense spared by its current owners in achieving a standard of outstanding quality and comfort. From the moment you step inside, the high-quality finish, tasteful décor and meticulous attention to detail are immediately evident, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere perfectly suited to modern living and entertaining alike. This is a home of genuine distinction, set within one of South Dublin's most desirable and established locations. The accommodation features a welcoming entrance hall, a beautifully decorated living room to the front, opening to a modern kitchen/dining room to the rear, three bedrooms (one currently set as an office), stylish ensuite shower room, stunning family bathroom and an enviable utility room. Outside there is convenient off-street parking to the front and a wonderful, most generous rear garden, which is a most ideal space for entertaining friends and family. \n\nThe location itself cannot be understated, situated within a mature setting and with a host of excellent local amenities on your doorstep. There is a selection of South Dublin's finest primary and secondary schools such as Our Lady's School, Terenure College, Templeogue College, St Mac Dara's, St Pius X., Bishop Galvin and Bishop Shanahan, Holy Spirit Primary and Riverview Educate Together. There is a range of shopping facilities all close by to include The Ashleaf, Orwell and Rathfarnham shopping centres. Sports and recreational facilities are also at a premium with St Judes GAA Club, Faughs GAA Club, Robert Emmets GAA Club, Templeogue United Football Club, Templeogue Tennis Club and St Marys Rugby Club all within striking distance. There are a number of bus routes nearby, providing easy access to the city centre and the M50 network is just minutes away offering access to all major national routes. Tymon Park is also situated only a stones' throw away from the property. Viewing is a must to see what the superb property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.11m x 3.07m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.25m x 2.09m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.77m x 3.22m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.25m x 2.87m\n\n\nBedroom 3/Office - 3.63m x 2.04m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.04m x 1.80m\n\n\nUtility Room - 2.04m x 1.37m\n\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.28m x 4.55m\n\n\nEnsuite - 2.07m x 1.71m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Fabulous 3 bed/ 2 bath dormer bungalow</li><li> Beautifully upgraded over the last 9 years, to include a dormer attic upgrade (c. 2022) and converted garage (c. 2017 approx.)</li><li> Beautiful, most generous landscaped rear garden</li><li> Fully rewired and replumbed</li><li> GFCH</li><li> Heat Recovery Ventilation System - improving air quality whilst saving energy</li><li> Internally insulated throughout</li><li> EV charger</li><li> Security alarm</li><li> A-rated double glazing throughout</li><li> Prime sought-after location</li><li> Family friendly neighbourhood</li><li> Within walking distance of Terenure, Templeogue, Perrystown and Rathfarnham villages</li><li> Every possible amenity nearby including excellent schools, shopping facilities, cafes/restaurants, bus connections and leisure/recreational facilities</li><li> Convenient to the city centre and the M50 road network</li><li> D1 BER rating.</ul>"
      },
